        <b>As Usual, Words Without Pictures are Less Than Half the Show</b>, <nobr>October 19, 2002</nobr>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom:0.5em;">
        <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top">By&nbsp;</td><td><a href="http://www.amazon.com/gp/pdp/profile/AKCF45Z2DV6TN/ref=cm_cr_dp_pdp/103-1253043-4631034"><span style = "font-weight: bold;">Michael Weber "fairportfan"</span></a> (Atlanta)  - <a href="http://www.amazon.com/gp/cdp/member-reviews/AKCF45Z2DV6TN/ref=cm_cr_dp_auth_rev/103-1253043-4631034?ie=UTF8&sort%5Fby=MostRecentReview">See all my reviews</a><br />
